class: negative
summary: a rooted negative names its target among its args, which come before the module its root gives, so a refusal particular to Darwin through a module that imports platform/linux is pinned on every lane
program: main.ldn
root: root
args: --target=darwin-arm64
expect: expected.txt
codes: L0201
constructs: 1420, 1480
targets: darwin-arm64
